### Step 1: Write the system in matrix form

We can write the system as a matrix equation:

$$
\begin{bmatrix}
1 & k & -1 \\
k & -1 & -1 \\
1 & 1 & -k
\end{bmatrix}
\begin{bmatrix}
x \\
y \\
z
\end{bmatrix}
=
\begin{bmatrix}
0 \\
0 \\
0
\end{bmatrix}
$$

Expanding along the first row:

$$
\det(A) = 1 \cdot 
\begin{vmatrix}
-1 & -1 \\
1 & -k
\end{vmatrix}
- k \cdot 
\begin{vmatrix}
k & -1 \\
1 & -k
\end{vmatrix}
+ (-1) \cdot 
\begin{vmatrix}
k & -1 \\
1 & 1
\end{vmatrix}
$$
